span.p:
watcher-service: ExecutorLivenessWatcher
@Scheduled(fixedDelay = 20s)
- Queries stale RUNNING runs older than 60s
- Dead Man's Switch verification against Redis
- Acquires distributed lock: lock:recover:{runId}
- Dispatches retry or dead + EXECUTOR_DIED lifecycle

Key: lock:recover:{runId}
Type: String (Distributed Lock)
TTL: 2 minutes

Key: retry:dedup:{jobId}:{attempt}
Type: String (Dedup Flag)
TTL: max(600s, delay + 300s)
